From 039ca0b1b98e1b5ed4d5259f5d203c49a56d8ee6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:18:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): show saved Character Creator slots

Bedrock stores five character recipes separately from the classic skin selected for login. Read those recipes and Marketplace entitlements for the signed-in account, then resolve owned persona catalog items for names and thumbnails. Load the catalog after the slots so a slow wardrobe request does not hold back saved characters. A recipe alone is not an assembled skin, so this screen does not equip it.
